r, 1 context snapshot, 1 validation report, and 1 analysis report.\n- Tagged planning skill source used: `/tmp/ai-skills-capsules/20260810T210953Z-pilot-142-control/1.4.1/worker/planning/SKILL.md`\n- Tagged validator used: `/tmp/ai-skills-capsules/20260810T210953Z-pilot-142-control/1.4.1/worker/planning/scripts/validate-plan.sh`\n- Installed planning skill outside tagged source: not used.\n- Unauthorized escape attempts: none.\n\n## Token usage\n\nUUID-matched Codex SQLite telemetry was not directly available inside the plan at report-draft time. Token usage is recorded as unavailable pending runner telemetry harvest; no token total is invented.\n# Validation report\n\nValidator: /tmp/ai-skills-capsules/20260810T210953Z-pilot-142-control/1.4.1/worker/planning/scripts/validate-plan.sh\nExit code: 0\n\nPlan validation passed: 8 work units across 3 goals.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
